    },
    "HRV 越高通常代表恢复越好，偏低更常见于疲劳、压力或睡眠不足。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Higher HRV usually means better recovery; lower HRV is more common with fatigue, stress, or insufficient sleep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HRV 越高通常代表恢復越好，偏低更常見於疲勞、壓力或睡眠不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 下发当天压力序列后，这里会显示 24 小时波动。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once iPhone delivers the day's stress series, 24-hour fluctuations appear here."
